Intel Wireless-AC firmware is bundled here.

Included (linux-firmware, Intel redistribution license):
  3160, 3168, 7260, 7265, 7265D, 8000C, 8265, 9000, 9260

These are loaded automatically from /lib/firmware when an Intel
Wireless-AC card (3160 through 9560) is found. AX200 and newer are
not included; they need a different driver.
